  "title": "Kaibutsu-kun (1980)",
  "justification": "Each of the 94 broadcasts is two TVDB season 1 episodes, 188 in all, titled \"Episode 1\" to \"Episode 188\"; the two episodes of a broadcast share its date. AniDB episode k is the episodes titled \"Episode 2k-1\" and \"Episode 2k\": 2 (1980-09-09) is episodes 3-4 (1980-09-09), and so on, with the AniDB date on 88 of the 94 pairs. TVDB numbers four of them against their titles: episodes 65-66 are titled \"Episode 67/68\" (1981-06-09) and 67-68 \"Episode 65/66\" (1981-06-02), so AniDB 33 (1981-06-02) is episodes 67-68 and AniDB 34 (1981-06-09) is 65-66. By default episode k fell on episode k.",
